    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scaredy Cat</strong> is a pixel mystery  adventure title that begins with a familiar tale.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Henny</strong> has been worn to the bone by a soul-sucking corporate career that has gifted her with heart problems. Swept up in a rare glimpse of emotion, she rage quits and starts pet sitting. Little does she know, her new gig will be just as horrifying as her last.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919030/extras/998e8d6c8a40cd2364ea867229f5cc2e.avif?t=1746825543\" width=350 height=74 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A lovingly crafted and emotional narrative with a deeper message</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A perfect mesh of beloved 2D pixel graphics and narrative-as-a-pillar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Deep, well-developed characters that you can learn about at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore the city of Conhaven and its surroundings - beautiful pixel environments that eradiate spook and atmosphere</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919030/extras/eb94e02d57d2d9ff1ee34ab632a30855.avif?t=1746825543\" width=350 height=74 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Select Pet Sitting Gigs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Solve environmental and cognitive puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Care for critters and encounter supernatural horrors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover touching stories about pet owners</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Progress through gigs to uncover a more sinister plot and become a more brave and purposeful Henny</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2919030/extras/52f15e29024578505297da4f81ca1aff.avif?t=1746825543\" width=350 height=74 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can pet a dog (or a cat... or an exotic turtle)</p></li></ul>",
